	(text "Telemetry receiver, Si4463 upconversion (2026-09-28). LT5560 up-converts 50MHz -> 168.3-169.2MHz (LO = Si5351 CLK1, 118.2MHz fixed, own PLL).\nL7/C25/C26: SPF5043Z bias RFC + DC block to mixer. C27-C29: LT5560 IN-/LO-/OUT- AC grounds (were tied straight to GND).\nL8/L9: LT5560 open-collector IF output feeds, value per LT5560 datasheet output network at 169MHz.\nL10-L12 / C31-C35: 3-pole top-C-coupled LC band-pass, ~168.75MHz, ~3-5MHz BW, 50 ohm -- values TBD (design + SPICE).\nC36/L13/C37: Si4463 differential LNA match -- PLACEHOLDER topology, take topology + values from Silicon Labs AN643 (169MHz).\nU13 receive-only. IO10 freed (old ADC_IN). See TX_Hardware/TX_Schematic_Blueprint.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
